One thing you can take advantage of is that the portal always starts
on the right side of the map.  If you levitate and head over to that
side as soon as you enter the plane, you can search a much smaller
area and often find the portal without too much trouble.  I've used
the Bell of Opening on a couple occasions to find it.

This is a lot faster if you've genocided sea creatures - one of the
main reasons why I do so if I have leftover genocide scrolls.


